  ],
  "notes": [
    "The pinned Aminet 1.0 archive supplies Michael Spindler's handler. BCWB supplies the startup launcher, updated readme and project icon.",
    "The startup project registers Eject ADF image in the Tools menu and on Right Amiga+J. The handler reads selected root icons and dispatches DAControl INFO and EJECT DEVICE.",
    "The shared system supplies the startup sequence and OS interfaces. This package owns no drawers."
